Theorem RL-7: dynamic COW (Uniqueness = MaybeShared) — IsShared check + branch

  Preconditions:
    - RL-7 governs dynamic COW per Annex E §AIMS COW: "Dynamic COW
      (MaybeShared): emit IsShared check, branch to in-place / copy."
    - Signature ArcFunction x AimsStateMap -> ArcFunction per
      the canonical proof notation:264; discharged against the sec-01
      Realization.proof sorry obligation.
    - DP-4 (needs_cow_check) <=> Uniqueness = MaybeShared (Appendix C
      DP-4): a runtime IsShared check is needed exactly when the static
      uniqueness is unknown.
    - DP-9 cow_mode: MaybeShared AND param IC-3 ParamContract.uniqueness =
      Unique -> StaticUnique (the caller proved RC == 1, a past guarantee);
      MaybeShared else -> Dynamic (runtime IsShared check selects in-place /
      copy).
    - Shipped: realize/decide.rs::decide_annotations + emit_rc/cow.rs.
    - depends-on sec-05: DP-4 (needs_cow_check) + DP-9 (cow_mode) soundness.
    - depends-on sec-06: IC-3 ParamContract.uniqueness is the caller-proven
      past guarantee that upgrades a MaybeShared param to StaticUnique.

  Soundness property:
    Forall owned value v with Uniqueness(v) = MaybeShared at a mutation
    point:

      (P1) Mode decision: RL-7 emits a runtime IsShared check (Dynamic mode)
           iff DP-4 fires (MaybeShared) AND the caller has NOT proven param
           uniqueness via IC-3. When IC-3 proves the param Unique, the mode
           upgrades to StaticUnique (no runtime check).

      (P2) Value-semantics preservation: the runtime IsShared check selects
           in-place mutation on the RC == 1 branch (no other reference
           exists) and copy on the RC > 1 branch (the copy isolates the
           mutation). BOTH branches preserve value semantics.

    RL-7 refines plain ARC by selecting the correct branch at runtime only
    when the static analysis cannot prove uniqueness, and by skipping the
    check entirely when IC-3 supplies a caller-side uniqueness proof.

  Proof obligation:
    Constructive discharge by the case_analysis engine via finite
    enumeration of the MaybeShared mode grid + per-branch value-semantics
    check.

    Part (P1/P2) — DP-4 gate + DP-9 mode + soundness:
      The verifier enumerates and asserts the DP-4 needs_cow_check gate, the
      DP-9 mode selection, and its value-semantics soundness on each branch:
        maybeshared_dynamic_check -> DP-4 fires, Dynamic (sound — both
                                           runtime branches preserve
                                           semantics)
        maybeshared_param_unique_static -> DP-4 fires but IC-3 caller proof
                                           upgrades to StaticUnique (sound —
                                           caller proved RC == 1)
        unique_no_dynamic_check -> DP-4 false (Unique); StaticUnique,
                                           no runtime check
      Coverage gate: 3 mode decisions, each cross-checked against DP-4 / DP-9
      and verified value-semantics-preserving.

    Engines dispatched:
      case_analysis (PRIMARY — section_08::verify_rl7_dynamic_cow; finite
        MaybeShared-mode grid + DP-4 gate cross-check + per-branch
        value-semantics check; emits Fail on a DP-4/DP-9 divergence or an
        unsound branch)
      rc_counting (SECONDARY — gracious-accept per the coverage-manifest RL
        row)
      refinement (SECONDARY — gracious-accept per the coverage-manifest RL
        row)

  Expected:
    status: valid
    reason: section_08 case_analysis engine discharges RL-7 via the DP-4 needs_cow_check gate + DP-9 mode grid (MaybeShared -> Dynamic runtime IsShared; MaybeShared+IC-3-param-unique -> StaticUnique; Unique -> no check) with a per-branch value-semantics-preservation check confirming both the in-place (RC==1) and copy (RC>1) runtime branches are sound, grounded in the shipped realize/decide.rs decide_annotations COW decision
